      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "The man is mapped as the subject of the hateful statement",
      "description": "The text 'i normally rape goats. but little boys are okay' is directly associated with the visual of the man, implying that he is the person who commits these acts. The man's stern expression and crossed arms serve as a visual representation of the perpetrator described in the text, creating an analogical mapping where the textual subject ('i') is projected onto the visual entity ('man').",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
